.Sh STANDARDS
The library implements the ELF format as specified in:
.Rs
.%A TIS (Tool Interface Standards)
.%T Executable and Linking Format (ELF) Specification
.%D May 1995
.Re
.Rs
.%A System V Application Binary Interface
.%T System V ABI
.%D 2010
.Re
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm libelfobj
library was written for the Substrate operating system to provide
a lightweight, embeddable ELF handling library suitable for use in
toolchain components, debuggers, and the dynamic linker.
.Sh BUGS
The library does not currently support:
.Bl -bullet
.It
ELF program headers (segments).
.It
Dynamic linking entries.
.It
Version scripts and symbol versioning.
.It
COMDAT group section garbage collection.
.El
